name: Nine-boundary job identity and complete narrow Report paging
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME budget
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/large-scope-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 25 parked | paused-work
type: held boundary draft
nav-mode:
keys: C-_
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
resize: 120x36
live-snap: selected-job-120x36
expect: integration-trial-003
expect: work paused
resize: 160x48
live-snap: selected-job-160x48
expect: integration-trial-003
expect: work paused
resize: 96x89
live-snap: selected-job-96x89
expect: integration-trial-003
expect: work paused
resize: 80x24
live-snap: selected-job-80x24
expect: integration-trial-003
expect: work paused
resize: 60x20
live-snap: selected-job-60x20
expect: integration-trial-003
expect: work paused
resize: 40x12
live-snap: selected-job-40x12
expect: integration-trial-003
expect: work paused
ask: Does the last job retain a distinct full trial identity, paused-work controls and keyboard selection across all six sizes without losing the composer draft?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
live-snap: restored-draft
expect: held boundary draft
keys: C-u
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 2 committed / 4 calls | partial-report
resize: 40x12
live-snap: report-page-00
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-01
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-02
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-03
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-04
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-05
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-06
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-07
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-08
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-09
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-10
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-11
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-13
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-14
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-15
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-16
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-17
keys: PgDn
live-snap: report-page-18
